,"book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-lukang"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077","text":"《書》曰：‘與其殺不辜，寧失不經。’而蕃等罪名未定，大辟以加，心經忠義，身被極刑，豈不痛哉！且已死之刑，固無所識，至乃焚爍流漂，棄之水濱，懼非先王之正典，或甫侯之所戒也。是以百姓哀聳，士民同戚。蕃、勖永已，悔亦靡及，誠望陛下赦召玄出，而頃聞薛瑩卒見逮錄。瑩父綜納言先帝，傅弼文皇，及瑩承基，內厲名行，今之所坐，罪在可宥。臣懼有司未詳其事，如復誅戮，益失民望，乞垂天恩，原赦瑩罪，哀矜庶獄，清澄刑網，則天下幸甚！","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"蕃","kind":"person","person_id":"z8o_i3j_zja","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077:m0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"甫侯","kind":"person","person_id":"zoh_v2m_0ol","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077:m0097","start":97,"end":98,"surface":"蕃","kind":"person","person_id":"z8o_i3j_zja","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077:m0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"勖","kind":"person","person_id":"01s_47v_vif","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077:m0114","start":114,"end":115,"surface":"玄","kind":"person","person_id":"30b_08l_rxm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077:m0121","start":121,"end":122,"surface":"瑩","kind":"person","person_id":"57a_8f8_a32","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077:m0127","start":127,"end":128,"surface":"瑩","kind":"person","person_id":"57a_8f8_a32","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077:m0129","start":129,"end":130,"surface":"綜","kind":"person","person_id":"yt7_qwp_k7p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-lukang:line077:m0132","start":132,